# Feature packages

Package name: `feature_<name>`. Layout:

```
features/<name>/lib/
  <name>.dart                 # barrel
  src/
    data/                     # optional
    application/              # controllers, state
    presentation/pages|widgets/
    routes/                   # build<Name>Routes(Ref)
    translations/             # <name>_en.i18n.json + <name>_fa.i18n.json
```

- Page (`ConsumerWidget`) watches Riverpod; widgets are dumb (no `ref`).
- Routes use `AppRoutes.x.path` / `.name` and `buildRoutePage`.
- Wire `...build<Name>Routes(ref)` in `apps/bedeh_bestan/.../app_router.dart`.
- Full checklist: `docs/architecture/03-feature-anatomy.md`.
